'' AN OS TABLE IS READ ONLY FOR ITS OS (TK-003): a build for Linux drops [target.app.windows]'s
'' '.rc' -- which a Linux build refuses (TKO0108) -- and takes [target.app.linux]'s define.
'' TEST: cli
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.bol/cache
'' CLEAN: build/.bol
'' ARGS: metadata -target linux-x86_64 --manifest tests/driver/src/build-os
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: "resources":[]
'' EXPECT-OUT: "-d","LINUXONLY=1"
'' EXPECT-NOT: app.rc
